		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">35</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">1. Normal test cases - length of the array is like 5, 8 and 10 .
1.1 When there is only 1 leader element in the array.
1.2 When there is multiple leader elements in the array


Based on these hints, you can come up with at least 2 new test cases.
