		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">45</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are some hints to put the logic in words.

1. As there are 1000 elements in the array, it will be difficult for me to remember all the elements of the array, so I will write all the elements of  the array in paper.
2. Now I know rightmost element is always  a leader element, so I will write it down
3. Since if there are too many leader elements so it will be difficult for me to remember all the leader elements, so I have to write all the leader elements in the paper.
4. Now I will start from second last element of the array and compare it with the last element and see which is greater, this is to keep track of the maximum element to the right side of any element.
5. So here I have observed that I have to start from last element of array and move to start unlike the previous problems that I solved also I have to keep track of maximum value from rigt of any element.</attribute>
